ment reminiscent of classic RTS games.<br></li><li>Strategic Battlefield Manipulation: Master the art of 'Tactical Terrain Alteration' to control enemy paths and create strategic choke points.<br></li><li>Potent Spellcasting Abilities: Change the course of battles with powerful spells, each providing critical tactical benefits.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/2e560a4750e2d97853b3a17b09b506ca.poster.avif?t=1705777484\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/2e560a4750e2d97853b3a17b09b506ca.webm?t=1705777484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/2e560a4750e2d97853b3a17b09b506ca.mp4?t=1705777484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/7f1d12330bcf5b20ff9be4331229533c.webp?t=1705777484\" width=618 height=50 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Attack Gems: Amplify your towers with devastating area-of-effect spells and chain-reaction magic.<br></li><li>Elemental Gems: Infuse towers with elemental powers to shock, burn, freeze, or poison adversaries.<br></li><li>Support Gems: Elevate your towers' defensive and offensive capabilities for a strategic edge.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/ae21f79496a41df54fb57b4499941399.poster.avif?t=1705777484\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/ae21f79496a41df54fb57b4499941399.webm?t=1705777484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"http