b_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/12bba0e65882b4621daf977664f607a3.poster.avif?t=1705777484\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/12bba0e65882b4621daf977664f607a3.webm?t=1705777484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/12bba0e65882b4621daf977664f607a3.mp4?t=1705777484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2609540/extras/3a89107fbeab5da810ea57f62ade5ccd.webp?t=1705777484\" width=618 height=50 /></span><br>Once upon a time in a medieval realm, nestled among rolling hills and lush forests, stood the majestic Kingdom of Yurei, home to a remarkable community of female angels. Within its halls, the air was filled with a sense of serenity and camaraderie. Castle Yurei was led by Queen Seraph and her daughter, Princess Tennyo, a wise and compassionate set of angels who embodied strength and grace. In this realm, same-sex love was the only celebrated and embraced love.<br><br>However, not far from Castle Yurei, atop a forbidding mountain, loomed the imposing Kingdom Jomon. Within its dark and brooding walls resided a sinister community of demonic same-sex loving men. Led by Prince Akuma, a fearsome and power-hungry figure, their civilization thrives on discord and chaos. Prince Akuma sought to spread his twisted ideology throughout the realm. Prince Akuma has declared war, driven by his hatred for the harmonious existence of Castle Yurei. The angels, determined to protect their sanctuary and their way of life, prepared for battle. Meanwhile, within Castle Jomon, the gay demons assembled under Prince Akuma\u2019s command. With flames flickering in their eyes and fire coursing through 